---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../../components/FinalCTA.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Trades & construction — alcohol interlock for vans and site vehicles | Interlock Alert"
  description="Camera-verified alcohol interlock devices for UK trades and construction firms — protect the contract, the insurance and the company name on the bodywork."
>
  <section class="hero hero--inner">
    <div class="hero__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wrap hero__grid">
      <div class="hero__copy reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">For trades &amp; construction</span>
        <h1 class="display">
          Lose a driver. <span class="display__fade">Don't lose the contract.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__sub">
          Site vehicles and van fleets where a single drink-drive incident doesn't just ground a driver — it pulls the contract, the insurance and the company name with it. Interlock Alert puts a verified pass on record before the ignition turns.
        </p>
        <div class="hero__cta">
          <a href="/contact" class="button button--primary button--lg">
            <span class="button__label">Get a Free Quote</span>
            <svg class="icon-18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero__visual reveal reveal--delay-2">
        <figure class="hero__media">
          <img
            src="/images/site-vehicles.png"
            alt="Construction site vehicles and vans on a UK building site"
            class="hero__media-img"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--band">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <header class="section__header section__header--center reveal">
        <span class="section__eyebrow">The problem</span>
        <h2 class="section__heading">One incident is enough to take the whole job with it.</h2>
        <p class="section__lede">For most trades businesses, a single drink-drive event triggers a chain reaction — the driver loses their licence, the project loses its access pass, the insurer reprices the policy, and the principal contractor asks hard questions. A preventive interlock isn't a luxury at this end of the market; it's the cheapest insurance you'll ever buy.</p>
      </header>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <header class="section__header reveal">
        <span class="section__eyebrow">What you get</span>
        <h2 class="section__heading">Designed for vans, sites and mixed crews.</h2>
      </header>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature reveal">
          <div class="feature__icon"><svg class="icon-24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield-check"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="feature__title">Site-pass-grade audit trail</h3>
          <p class="feature__body">Camera-verified, GPS-stamped, timestamped tests. The kind of evidence your principal contractor and insurer actually want to see.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature reveal reveal--delay-1">
          <div class="feature__icon"><svg class="icon-24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-users"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="feature__title">Multi-driver vehicles</h3>
          <p class="feature__body">Vans that get handed between crews work fine. The driver-ID camera attributes every test to the person actually behind the wheel.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature reveal reveal--delay-2">
          <div class="feature__icon"><svg class="icon-24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-bolt"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="feature__title">Petrol, diesel, hybrid &amp; EV</h3>
          <p class="feature__body">Mixed-fleet ready out of the box — from the diesel tipper to the new electric van. One supplier, one portal, one bill.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature reveal">
          <div class="feature__icon"><svg class="icon-24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-wrench"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="feature__title">Warranty-safe install</h3>
          <p class="feature__body">Certified auto-electricians fit at the ECU level — no impact on dealer warranty, MOT or telematics already on the vehicle.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature reveal reveal--delay-1">
          <div class="feature__icon"><svg class="icon-24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-bell"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="feature__title">Live alerts on a fail</h3>
          <p class="feature__body">A failed test reaches your office or site manager in seconds — not at the next service visit. Decisions made before damage is done.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature reveal reveal--delay-2">
          <div class="feature__icon"><svg class="icon-24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield-check"/></svg></div>
          <h3 class="feature__title">Lowest monthly pricing</h3>
          <p class="feature__body">Per-device monthly fee. No activation, no per-test, no multi-year lock-in. Scale up the fleet without renegotiating the deal.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FinalCTA
    heading="Cheaper than the contract you'd lose without it."
    body="Share your van count, drivetrains and base postcode and we'll come back with a tailored quote and an installation slot that works around your project schedule."
  />
</Layout>
